# Copy to .env.local for local dev, or set in the Vercel project's
# Environment Variables settings for deployed builds. Never commit the
# actual value — this file documents the name only.
#
# Server-side only: read by api/asset/[id].ts, never bundled into client
# code (no VITE_ prefix — Vite would compile a VITE_-prefixed var into the
# public JS bundle, defeating the point of keeping it server-side).
#
# Gates the Pro asset tier (§11.1/§11.2). Omit entirely to run free-tier
# assets only — the app falls back to procedural placeholders regardless.
POLYFORK_PRO_TOKEN=
